# --- 1. Python Essentials ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.tox/
**/.nox/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# --- 2. Build & Distribution ---
**/dist/
**/build/
**/*.egg-info/
**/*.spec

# --- 3. Data & AI Orchestration (Crucial for Token Savings) ---
**/data/            # Exclude large datasets
**/logs/            # Exclude massive log files
**/outputs/         # Exclude AI generated runs/results
**/.airflow/        # Local airflow run data
**/airflow_home/    # Local Airflow DB/metadata
**/mlruns/          # MLflow artifact store
**/db/              # Local SQLite or DB files

# --- 4. Secrets & Environment ---
**/.env
**/secrets.yaml

# --- 5. Cursor/IDE Artifacts ---
**/.cursor/cache/
**/.cursor/index/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.git/
**/*.log

.codeiumignore